OL,3,CSkygazers gather across the South East
OL,4,Cto watch the spectacular solar eclipse
OL,6,FObservatory Science Centre,
OL,7,FHerstmonceux
OL,9,FAround four hundred visitors gathered
OL,10,Fat the Observatory to mark the event
OL,11,Fat the grade two listed site.
OL,13,FInside the green domes, the
OL,14,Fsophisticated telescopes were also
OL,15,Fgiven special filters so people could
OL,16,Fget a close-up view of the Moon
OL,17,Fpassing over the Sun.
OL,19,FAt sea off the Kent coast
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/4
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
