PN,38303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1786605487
OL,3,CSkygazers gather across the South East
OL,4,Cto watch the spectacular solar eclipse
OL,6,FOff the coast of Dover, in the middle
OL,7,Fof the Channel, people were able to
OL,8,Fenjoy the solar eclipse on a boat.
OL,10,FRun by the charity Wetwheels, the boat
OL,11,Fallows wheelchair users to experience
OL,12,Fpower boating and is fully wheelchair
OL,13,Faccessible.
OL,15,FJames Dunn, skipper, said: "It's great
OL,16,Fto be able to get anyone out here to
OL,17,Fwatch it with the massive horizon we
OL,18,Fget out here, they get a much better
OL,19,Fview."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/4
