PN,38304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1786605487
OL,3,CSkygazers gather across the South East
OL,4,Cto watch the spectacular solar eclipse
OL,6,FReculver Towers and Roman Fort, Herne
OL,7,FBay
OL,9,FEnglish Heritage and the South East
OL,10,FKent Astronomical Society (SEKAS)
OL,11,Farranged an event at Reculver Towers
OL,12,Fand Roman Fort in Herne Bay.
OL,14,FAstronomers were on hand with
OL,15,Fspecialist solar telescopes and
OL,16,Feclipse viewing glasses so people
OL,17,Fcould view the eclipse safely.
OL,19,FVisitors were also able to climb to
OL,20,Fthe top of Reculver's North Tower to
OL,21,Fenjoy panoramic views.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/4
